**Controls.** ℓ=0 closure ≡ the charged driver; Xu's four printed §6 values reproduced; retrodiction 7/7 (the child instrument kills exactly the already-dead parents). The sharpest one: R001's child dies at `4 < 5` — Xu's own §6.2(i) numbers — via the new `Cor 5.3^ℓ`, closing a set-difference the charged replay could not reproduce.

